  "rules5": [
    "Human calls to businesses with a good script are OK: weekdays 10 am-6 pm their time is legal everywhere; the Call button follows each state's exact hours. Say who you are and that it is a sales call.",
    "Check numbers against the National Do Not Call list (free for 5 area codes); keep your own do-not-call list forever.",
    "No AI voice, robocall, recorded message or ringless voicemail to anyone without signed consent: $500 to $1,500 per call.",
    "Emails: real name, honest subject, your postal address, an opt-out that works. Texts: only to people who said yes, with Reply STOP.",
    "AI is your coach (scripts, research, demo sites, notes, email drafts), never the caller."
